== Documented Changes ==
=== Gameplay Changes ===
* {{e|Little Horn}} now takes reduced damage from his own bombs (this prevents him from killing himself too quickly).
* {{e|Little Horn}}'s orange champion variant now uses unique flaming troll bomb sprites and always spawns flaming troll bombs when teleporting around the room.
* Updated several room layouts.
* Updated localization files.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed a bug which prevented scores from being submitted upon winning a [[daily run]].
* Fixed missing champion sprites for {{e|Rag Man}}.
* Fixed champion {{e|Mask of Infamy}} not using its unique champion sprites.
* Fixed champion versions of {{e|Chub}}, {{e|Little Horn}}, {{e|Rag Man}}, {{e|Brownie}}, {{e|Peep}} and {{e|The Bloat}} not using the correct sprites for spawned enemies.
* Fixed champion {{e|War}} and {{e|Death}} not using the correct sprites when transitioning to their second phase.
* Fixed {{i|Lil Loki}} not counting towards the [[Conjoined]] transformation (for real this time!)
* Fixed {{e|Clutch}}'s {{e|Clickety Clack}}s not dealing contact damage after being revived.
* Fixed reviving as {{c|Lazarus}} resetting his [[Devil Deal]] chance even if Red Heart damage was taken during the current floor.
* Fixed {{c|Bethany}}'s unlock condition not working as intended due to {{c|Lazarus}}' new revival mechanic.
* Fixed several special room doors not working correctly in the [[PAY TO PLAY]] challenge.
* Fixed {{i|Pay To Play}} locking doors that would normally be unlocked (such as the Silver {{r|Treasure Room}} in [[Greed Mode]]).

=== Modding changes ===
* Added missing enums for null items introduced by previous updates.

